de los grupos de más éxito de la historia. Carolina del Norte (dB's, Windbreakers), Hoboken (Smithereens, Bongos, Tiny Lights), el nacimiento del lo-fi (Half Japanese, Violent Femmes, Beat Happening, Guided By Voices, Sebadoh), They Might Be Giants, Green, B.A.L.L., Boston (Volcano Suns, 10,000 Maniacs, Throwing Muses, Blake Babies), la Costa Oeste (Game Theory, Posies, Young Fresh Fellows) y la sátira de Ween.","color":"#f472b6","family":"Pop, power-pop y synth-pop","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#college-pop"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":155802124157928,"artist":"Ween","artist_id":92029095903601,"title":"God Weed Satan - The Oneness","year":1990,"ess":0,"yt":"ugh0MhM-_Wg","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"College-pop y nacimiento del lo-fi","scene_id":243752875478949,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#college-pop","chapters":["Sección 5.10"],"pages":[[1,154,null]]},{"id":7416139999170,"artist":"Ween","artist_id":92029095903601,"title":"Pod","year":1992,"ess":0,"yt":"-V73cNdENbs","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"College-pop y nacimiento del lo-fi","scene_id":243752875478949,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#college-pop","chapters":["Sección 5.10"],"pages":[[1,154,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":154,"text":"…condition that countless poets had explored over the centuries. Satire, 1988-89 Lyrics often prevailed over music. In Pennsylvania, Mickey \"Dean Ween\" Melchiondo and Aaron \"Gene Ween\" Freeman created the saga of Ween (2), who represented the ultimate act of juvenile, caustic and lewd irreverence. God Weed Satan - The Oneness (1990) was their personal musica-hall,…"}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Early MP3-Only Album (1999)","body":"In 1999, Ween became one of the very first bands to release an MP3-only album, demonstrating their early adoption of digital music distribution. \"In 1999, they became one of the very first bands to release an MP3 only album.\"","year":1999,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Bent Bands","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I9_3EbwKPnU"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Eclectic and Absurdist Style","body":"Ween is described as eclectic, possessing a twisted sense of humor that heavily leans into the absurd and surreal. Their music is considered \"brainy\" rather than novelty. \"And they are eclectic, to say the least. They had a twisted sense of humor that leaned very heavily into the land of the absurd and the surreal. This is much more brainy than that if that's the word to use.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Bent Bands","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I9_3EbwKPnU"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Fishing Hobby","body":"Dean Ween enjoys fishing as a relaxing pastime. \"Dean Wien of the band Wien isn't to that.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Hobbies of Musicians","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xc85sLj0Cnk"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Genre Versatility","body":"The band experimented across genres, playing with rock and pop, and even recording a country album. \"They played with rock and pop. They recorded a country album.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Bent Bands","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I9_3EbwKPnU"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Major Label Releases","body":"Most of Ween's studio albums were released on major labels. \"And most of their studio albums were on major labels too.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Bent Bands","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I9_3EbwKPnU"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Pennsylvania Origin","body":"Ween is another group that originated from Pennsylvania. \"This is another group from Pennsylvania.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Bent Bands","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I9_3EbwKPnU"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":196873149355619,"type":"album","name":"God Ween Satan: The Oneness","list_id":152761658426523,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Comedy Rock","src":"musthear","rank":5,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"ugh0MhM-_Wg","scaruffi":null},{"id":196873149355619,"type":"album","name":"God Ween Satan: The Oneness","list_id":22478217896300,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Experimental Rock","src":"musthear","rank":194,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"ugh0MhM-_Wg","scaruffi":null},{"id":196873149355619,"type":"album","name":"God Ween Satan: The Oneness","list_id":90602747302117,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Punk Rock","src":"musthear","rank":168,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"ugh0MhM-_Wg","scaruffi":null},{"id":155802124157928,"type":"album","name":"God Weed Satan - The Oneness","work_year":1990,"list_id":13018320481353,"list":"Scaruffi 1990s","src":"charts","rank":360,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"ugh0MhM-_Wg","scaruffi":7.5},{"id":239139445002535,"type":"album","name":"GodWeenSatan: The Oneness","work_year":1990,"list_id":90391435651867,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1990","src":"charts","rank":183,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"ugh0MhM-_Wg","scaruffi":null},{"id":7416139999170,"type":"album","name":"Pod","list_id":114554236241704,"list":"RYM Top — Psychedelia — Neo-Psychedelia","src":"musthear","rank":114,"year":1992,"note":null,"yt":"vg2nwbl8WqI","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":7416139999170,"type":"album","name":"Pod","list_id":22478217896300,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Experimental Rock","src":"musthear","rank":118,"year":1992,"note":null,"yt":"vg2nwbl8WqI","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":7416139999170,"type":"album","name":"